  "prefLabel": "Tra 303.09 Requests for Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 303.09 Requests for Hearing.\n\n(a) An applicant or other affected person may request a hearing within 20 days after receipt of the notice of decision from the department or a locality.\n\n(b) The hearing request shall include a statement of the basis for contesting the decision of the department or a locality.\n\n(c) Requests for hearing shall be sent to:\n\nNH Department of Transportation\n\nJohn O. Morton Building\n\nOffice of the Commissioner\n\nP.O. Box 483\n\n7 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH 03301-0483\n\nSource. #12156, eff 4-6-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra300.html"
